From e936d47c539b4f968ca9e5e6ed56a4a9eea53bf1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Freimut Diener <f.diener@pengutronix.de>
Date: Sat, 27 Jun 2026 14:37:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 32/37] etnaviv/ml: support 2x nearest neighbor resize

Support the limited RESIZE_NEAREST_NEIGHBOR case used by quantized TFLite graphs: 2x spatial upscale, unchanged channels, identical 8-bit input/output quantization, and default resize coordinates.\n\nLower resize to four TP scatter passes, one for each output position in the 2x2 replicated block. Each pass writes one output sub-lattice, avoiding arithmetic in the TP datapath and preserving tensor bytes exactly.
---
