+   /* 2x nearest-neighbour resize is emitted as 4 TP scatter passes, one per
+    * 2x2 output sub-lattice. This selects which phase (0..3) this job writes:
+    * dx = resize_phase & 1, dy = (resize_phase >> 1) & 1.
+    */
